 0° ESE\n22:00  altitude 31°\, azimuth 106° ESE\n22:30  altitude 37°\, 
 azimuth 103° ESE\n23:00  altitude 43°\, azimuth 100° E\n23:30  altitude
  49°\, azimuth 97° E\n00:00  altitude 55°\, azimuth 94° E\n\nCAMERA PO
 SITION\nLake Lyell Recreation Park shoreline\, Magpie Hollow Road\, Rydal 
